rmer gang member, but she has a great reputation among the students because of how caring she is."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In a rush because she's already getting to be a certain age without having met anyone still, and is secretly worried about what to do."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Sekai Project"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c50693"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b8adf1d202d7412fdc78df9b4811ef49c314e9e0364bc65594386161262ebb31.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f2caa973cb2e8b5865892da56e6b7d0419db8f55b180d5b2593286943268e835.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"かわしま りの","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:64801","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c50694","characterName":"佐藤 虎太郎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c50694"},"originalCharacterName":"佐藤 虎太郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"310"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A first year student in the same class as Toa and Mihiro."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His small frame combined with his delicate figure and cute face clearly make him look like a girl, but he is a man, inside and out. After a certain incident, he begins to trust in the main character."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Sekai Project"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c50694"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/